        "Section"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "section_id": "section-2",
        "title": "1. Introduccion",
        "level": 2,
        "order": 2,
        "heading_type": "markdown",
        "numbering": "1",
        "start_line": 3,
        "end_line": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "node_id": "chunk:9c2e67b1cbeb1480:chunk-1",
      "labels": [
        "Chunk"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "chunk_id": "chunk-1",
        "text": "El algebra lineal estudia vectores, matrices y transformaciones lineales. Un vector puede representar una posicion, una direccion o una lista ordenada de valores.",
        "order": 1,
        "start_line": 5,
        "end_line": 5,
        "word_count": 23,
        "character_count": 162,
        "chunk_type": "paragraph"
      }
    },
    {
      "node_id": "section:9c2e67b1cbeb1480:section-3",
      "labels": [
        "Section"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "section_id": "section-3",
        "title": "1.1 Vectores",
        "level": 3,
        "order": 3,
        "heading_type": "markdown",
        "numbering": "1.1",
        "start_line": 7,
        "end_line": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "node_id": "chunk:9c2e67b1cbeb1480:chunk-2",
      "labels": [
        "Chunk"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "chunk_id": "chunk-2",
        "text": "Un vector tiene magnitud y direccion. En aprendizaje automatico, los vectores tambien pueden representar caracteristicas de objetos, textos o usuarios.",
        "order": 2,
        "start_line": 9,
        "end_line": 9,
        "word_count": 20,
        "character_count": 151,
        "chunk_type": "paragraph"
      }
    },
    {
      "node_id": "section:9c2e67b1cbeb1480:section-4",
      "labels": [
        "Section"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "section_id": "section-4",
        "title": "1.2 Matrices",
        "level": 3,
        "order": 4,
        "heading_type": "markdown",
        "numbering": "1.2",
        "start_line": 11,
        "end_line": 13
      }
    },
    {
      "node_id": "chunk:9c2e67b1cbeb1480:chunk-3",
      "labels": [
        "Chunk"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "chunk_id": "chunk-3",
        "text": "Una matriz organiza numeros en filas y columnas. Las matrices permiten describir sistemas de ecuaciones y transformar vectores de un espacio a otro.",
        "order": 3,
        "start_line": 13,
        "end_line": 13,
        "word_count": 23,
        "character_count": 148,
        "chunk_type": "paragraph"
      }
    },
    {
      "node_id": "section:9c2e67b1cbeb1480:section-5",
      "labels": [
        "Section"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "section_id": "section-5",
        "title": "2. Idea importante",
        "level": 2,
        "order": 5,
        "heading_type": "markdown",
        "numbering": "2",
        "start_line": 15,
        "end_line": 17
      }
    },
    {
      "node_id": "chunk:9c2e67b1cbeb1480:chunk-4",
      "labels": [
        "Chunk"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "chunk_id": "chunk-4",
        "text": "Los espacios vectoriales permiten estudiar relaciones entre objetos mediante operaciones como suma, multiplicacion por escalares y combinaciones lineales.",
        "order": 4,
        "start_line": 17,
        "end_line": 17,
        "word_count": 18,
        "character_count": 154,
        "chunk_type": "paragraph"
      }
    },
    {
      "node_id": "section:9c2e67b1cbeb1480:section-6",
      "labels": [
        "Section"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "section_id": "section-6",
        "title": "Conclusion",
        "level": 2,
        "order": 6,
        "heading_type": "markdown",
        "numbering": null,
        "start_line": 19,
        "end_line": 21
      }
    },
    {
      "node_id": "chunk:9c2e67b1cbeb1480:chunk-5",
      "labels": [
        "Chunk"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "chunk_id": "chunk-5",
        "text": "El tema central es que vectores y matrices funcionan como lenguaje comun para modelar datos y transformaciones.",
        "order": 5,
        "start_line": 21,
        "end_line": 21,
        "word_count": 17,
        "character_count": 111,
        "chunk_type": "paragraph"
      }
    },
